    "text": "Leaching of gold with dilute aqueous solution of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>NaCN</mi></math> in presence of oxygen gives complex <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mfenced></math>, which on reaction with zinc forms the elemental gold and another complex <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mfenced></math>. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mfenced></math>, respectively are"
